%% Admin Publishing Flow: Step-by-step when admin publishes a blog post
sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Admin<br/>(Browser)
    participant CF as CloudFront
    participant S3 as S3<br/>(Bucket)
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Cognito as Cognito<br/>(Auth)
    participant Lambda as Lambda/<br/>EC2
    participant Prisma as Prisma<br/>ORM
    participant RDS as RDS<br/>PostgreSQL

    Admin->>CF: 1. GET /admin
    CF-->>Admin: Admin UI (HTML/CSS/JS)

    Admin->>Admin: 2. Enter email & password
    Admin->>API: 3. POST /auth/login
    API->>Cognito: 4. Validate credentials
    Cognito-->>API: JWT token
    API-->>Admin: 5. JWT token (store in localStorage)

    Admin->>Admin: 6. Click "New Post"
    Admin->>Admin: 7. Fill form (title, content, category, tags)

    Admin->>API: 8. GET /s3-presigned-url
    API->>Lambda: Route request
    Lambda->>S3: Generate presigned URL
    S3-->>Lambda: URL expires in 15 min
    Lambda-->>API: Return URL
    API-->>Admin: 9. Presigned URL

    Admin->>S3: 10. PUT image.jpg (direct, using presigned URL)
    S3-->>Admin: 11. Upload confirmed

    Admin->>Admin: 12. Click "Save Draft"
    Admin->>API: POST /posts (with JWT header)
    API->>Cognito: Validate JWT
    Cognito-->>API: ✓ Valid

    API->>Lambda: Route request
    Lambda->>Prisma: Create post record
    Prisma->>RDS: BEGIN TRANSACTION
    RDS-->>Prisma: Transaction open
    Prisma->>RDS: INSERT INTO posts (title, slug, content, authorId, published=false)
    Prisma->>RDS: INSERT INTO post_categories (postId, categoryId)
    Prisma->>RDS: INSERT INTO post_tags (postId, tagId)
    Prisma->>RDS: COMMIT
    RDS-->>Prisma: Rows inserted (post ID: 123)
    Prisma-->>Lambda: { id: 123, title: "...", ... }

    Lambda->>Lambda: Store S3 image URL in response
    Lambda-->>API: 13. Success response
    API-->>Admin: 14. Draft saved (post ID: 123)

    Admin->>Admin: 15. Click "Publish"
    Admin->>API: PATCH /posts/123 (published=true, with JWT)
    API->>Lambda: Route request
    Lambda->>Prisma: Update post.published = true
    Prisma->>RDS: UPDATE posts SET published=true WHERE id=123
    RDS-->>Prisma: Row updated

    Lambda->>CF: 16. Invalidate cache /api/posts*
    CF-->>Lambda: Cache cleared

    Lambda-->>API: 17. Success
    API-->>Admin: 18. "Post published!"
    Admin->>Admin: 19. Redirect to post URL
